  "_comment": "Copy to ~/.claude/claudevoice.json (chmod 600). `node setup.js` / `cloudflare/deploy.sh` write this for you. Optional extra key \"webUrl\": \"https://cc.example.com\" adds CloudCLI deep links to notifications (docs/CONFIGURATION.md section 9); omit it for no links. Remove this _comment key if you like.",
